Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:07.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:11.08,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:15.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:20.97,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.96,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:33.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:47.80,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.65,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:54.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:00.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:03.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.57,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:19.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.09,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:28.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:32.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:43.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon guards, come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:01.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(418,523)\fad(300,300)}Feng Yin\NDemon Guard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:01:59.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon guard Feng Yin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're finally getting a real task.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:09.04,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(407,517)\fad(300,300)}De Gui\NDemon guard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:14.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon guard Hu Pao
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:15.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,is here !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:17.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master has ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:19.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,the execution of Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:20.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:23.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Soul Flag is now complete !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with the secret technique Master has given me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:32.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,kill you by my own hands !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:37.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1511,505)\fad(300,300)}Ancient Battlefield\NSky Demon Country
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:54.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,You do have some skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Taste this !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Earth Sore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,break !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:19.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Feng Yin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:21.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:23.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before my Heaven Pus and Earth Sore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,he has no chance of survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,After you're done,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:28.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,quickly go back to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll take the credit for this kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Return !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Feng Yin !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:09.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Death Finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:44.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,That celestial palm print...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:47.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could he know this spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:49.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have failed in my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:50.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I deserve to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Among the Demon guards, the only one left
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the one who controls millions of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,and that has the Instant Power spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,He will surely be able to injure him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Investigate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of Demon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,dares block Grandpa Xu's path !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:21.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are too many souls !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't you think that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:24.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,these spells look familiar ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:27.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Long time no see,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You little bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,it was you !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:42.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hu Pao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Excellency still remembers his discarded pawn ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,How should I properly repay you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:57.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,How about...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,killing you by my own hands !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, you seemed so lofty and unreachable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,But looking at you now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:12.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:16.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hu Pao,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:18.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,why did you decide
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,to betray me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Betray you !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're the one that betrayed me first !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where were you when I was thrown in that prison cell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,When my meridians were crushed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:32.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,my bones broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:34.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I suffered endless torment...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where were you !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:44.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was nothing but a pawn in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:46.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't met my Benefactor,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would have died long ago !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:49.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,you don't have to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:53.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,because I won't let you die easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will throw you into the cruelest prison of the 9 countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:00.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll tear your tendons, pull out your bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,and extract your soul to seal it into my Soul Flag !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That way you will neither live
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,nor die !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I owe you an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:16.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,for leaving you back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't need it !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,All I want now is to turn you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:22.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,and that Soul Refining Tribe of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,into my soul fragments !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't want to kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,just because of your hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your true goal
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to kill everyone that knows the Soul Refining spell
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be the last one to know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:38.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected of my former Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:45.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Correct !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I'm the only person aware of this spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:49.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,then one day
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will refine all living beings of this world !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even the Demon Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have to kneel before me !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are not worthy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,of seeing that day happen !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.64,0:08:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,One
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Instant
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:11.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Power !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hundred Million Soul Devour !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:21.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(403,599)}Hu Pao\NDemon guard\NRank 100 000 Demonic Energy\N(Middle stage Soul Transformation)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:23.68,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(403,599)}Hu Pao\NDemon guard\NRank 200 000 Demonic Energy\N(Late stage Soul Transformation)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:24.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(000,300)\pos(403,599)}Hu Pao\NDemon guard\NRank 300 000 Demonic Energy\N(Early stage Ascendant)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,For over a decade,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cultivated day and night
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:31.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,in order to create this Hundred Million-Soul Flag !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:33.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Combined with the spell my Benefactor gave me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:35.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:38.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are no longer my match !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.60,0:08:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:46.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are indeed very talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:50.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this isn't how you use
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:52.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Soul Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without the true inheritance,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,you cannot really control the souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your mighty ambition
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,is nothing but a fool's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:15.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:16.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,come back !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.84,0:09:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,come back !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:25.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is this possible !?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Benefactor had clearly fixed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,the flaw of the Soul Flag !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:31.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why !?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:34.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Benefactor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:35.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he truly cared about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:38.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,he wouldn't have taught you this so-called Instant Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sinister spell may temporarily boost your cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it drains
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,your lifespan and life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:52.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,When has this Benefactor of yours ever treated you properly ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:52.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shut up !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:54.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:57.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(403,599)}Hu Pao\NDemon guard\NRank 300 000 Demonic Energy\N(Early stage Ascendant)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:09:58.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(403,599)}Hu Pao\NDemon guard\NRank 200 000 Demonic Energy\N(Late stage Soul Transformation)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.40,0:09:59.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(000,300)\pos(403,599)}Hu Pao\NDemon guard\NRank 100 000 Demonic Energy\N(Middle stage Soul Transformation)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:00.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your luck has run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:20.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You ruined me !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:23.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you !!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:27.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you rebelled because of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:30.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,before you die
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:33.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shall let you see the true power of the Soul Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was my lack of foresight
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:28.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,that he had left a failsafe in the Soul Refining spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,it failed in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:33.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:35.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,He fought his way here single-handedly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and has already given me many surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:40.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, Ming Yuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:43.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,what is your cultivation level ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Late stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Demon Tower was given to me by Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:50.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's essential for my revival
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:51.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you must not fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,My patience is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.76,0:11:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you understand ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:57.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, I understand !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:11:59.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:01.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,to kill this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The effects of the Celestial Ascension Fruits
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,are beginning to fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:18.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Late stage Ascendant...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I have come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you really managed to fight your way here on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:28.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I commend your courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.84,0:12:32.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,that was foolish !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:35.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dao of...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:37.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Underworld !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:46.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wind !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impressive...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You do have a sliver of comprehension of the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rain !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,A physical form of demonic energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected of a Late stage Ascendant cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But killing me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:45.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Condense the River's Soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:50.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Slaughter Art !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:13.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,To be able to use your comprehension of the Dao to break my spell...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:17.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,that means you're at your limit !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:21.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such concentrated demonic energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me show you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:28.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,the true might of the demonic path !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:32.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if you use all your tricks,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,you'll merely block a single strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:38.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,can destroy you !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:44.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who said
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:45.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I wanted to kill you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:47.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:48.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ling Tianhou's sword !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:49.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,From the very beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:51.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,my target
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,has never been you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:58.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're courting death !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell your master
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:02.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,to come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a vindictive little brat !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You never cease to surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ming Yuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.72,0:15:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,you have disappointed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:18.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, spare...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:35.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been in this armor for so long
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I almost forgot
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,what having a body feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such pressure...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:44.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person's cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,is above Ascendant !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:49.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,What makes you think
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you can fight me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:54.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:56.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll give you 5 breaths to flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you have a death wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shall grant it !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn you !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:28.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's you !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,An Ascendant self-detonation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:36.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if your body and soul explode,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won't kill me !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:47.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're a complete madman !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:04.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Madman ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,If someone messes with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will destroy them !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:31.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,A complete madman !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,He gave up his life to destroy my Demon Tower !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,My countless years of accumulating energy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:40.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,were destroyed in an instant !
Dialogue: 100,0:17:43.56,0:20:17.64,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0000)}“When I was under the influence of the Celestial Ascension Fruits, I was able to create this underworld river with my Dao. Now that I’m sober, I’m still able to condense the soul of the river!”\NThe 100 million soul fragments fused with the underworld river and fused into one. This soul was the soul of the Underworld River!\N\NThe Underworld River now had a soul, so it suddenly moved when the wind, rain, thunder, and lightning descended from the sky. Wang Lin was inside the Underworld River. He spread out his Divine Sense and his Dao fused with the river. At this moment, his Origin Soul let out a roar and the Underworld river Charged into the sky.\N\NNow that it had a soul, the Underworld River seemed to have gained intelligence. It was like a dragon, as it let out a roar and wanted to devour the wind, rain, thunder, and lightning spell!\NAt the same time, 130 000 strands of slaughter energy came out from between Wang Lin’s eyebrows and fused with the dragon. Now this Underworld River carried killing intent!\N\NThis was Wang Lin’s real Underworld River. It contained 130 000 strands of slaughter energy, 100 million soul fragments, and Wang Lin’s Dao!
