Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:17.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:23.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
