Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.88,0:18:24.76,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:23.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}stand in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:30.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:31.04,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:30.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:35.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:35.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:43.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:43.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:48.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:48.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:56.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:56.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:19:00.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:00.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:04.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:04.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:10.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:10.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:14.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:14.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:17.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.16,0:19:17.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:23.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:23.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.44,0:19:29.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:29.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
